  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1717\">\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1717\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1641\">EGFR L858R mutation detected</strong>, known to confer sensitivity to EGFR TKIs (e.g., Osimertinib, Erlotinib).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1781\">\n<p data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1781\">No <strong data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1730\">ALK</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1740\">ROS1</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1752\">RET</strong> rearrangements identified.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1901\">\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1901\"><strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1806\">KRAS G12C mutation</strong> found &ndash; may suggest resistance to EGFR inhibitors; targeted KRAS inhibitors may be considered.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
